<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Additional Experiments ‣ TTRV: Test-Time Reinforcement Learning for Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Further Cross-Data Generalization Examples</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
