<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S4.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Image Classification.</span> Top-1 Accuracy (<math id="S4.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>%</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\%</annotation></semantics></math>) obtained by evaluating multiple different backbones. The results in <span id="S4.T1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">gray</span> are obtained using the specialized dual-encoder VLMs and the proprietary GPT-4o. For decoder-based VLMs we also evaluate multiple families and model sizes. Our TTRV is applied to different model sizes from the InternVL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib73" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhu et al., 2025</a>)</cite> family of models. The best results obtained for a dataset are highlighted in <span id="S4.T1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, while the second best are <span id="S4.T1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
