<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_block">Table 5: </span><span id="S4.T5.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Random Reward vs. TTRV.</span> We compare the results obtained by using random rewards (following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib49" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shao et al. (2025)</a></cite>) and our sophisticated reward design. The results highlight that the gains obtained with <em id="S4.T5.3.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">spurious rewards</em> do not transfer to Intern-VL family of models, which were shown for Qwen-based models.</figcaption>
</div></div></div>
</figure>
